<p>You lash out your psionic fury at a distant creature, doing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>mindpower 100">134, 180, 216, 246, 273</acronym> mind damage.</p><p>The whip can cleave to one nearby foe.</p><p>If you do not have two mindstars equiped, but have them in your off set, you instantly automatically switch. The wild psionic powers are incompatible with the focused nature of psiblades.</p>